    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just being tired though. it’s like... the idea of \"recharging\" or \"getting help\" feels like just another chore on a list that never ends. even talking about it feels exhausting. i just feel like i'm done. like the version of me that was supposed to do all this stuff is just gone, and there’s nothing to replace it. it just feels so permanent.",
