      "content": "\"letting go of the pressure\"... what does that even look like? because every time i try to relax or take a break, the world just keeps demanding things from me. i can't escape it. it feels like the only way to actually be quiet and stop the noise is... something more final. like, is it even possible to truly rest if you're still here?",
